// ---- the whole bank's power-up value, ONE entry per ADDRESS ----------
// The one-datapath-per-slot array cannot preset a cell from its own
// `always` block with a compile-time address (the address is `phase`-
// dependent), and a reset branch that walks the contexts makes Vivado see
// a VARIABLE-address write racing the commit write -- measured: 50x
// `[Synth 8-6859] multi-driven net on pin Q ... 2nd driver 'GND'` plus
// `8-6858 constant driver PRESERVED, other driver ignored` on `bank_reg[*][*]`,
// which both zeroes live state and folds the datapath away (the same
// design reported 203 LUT / 962 FF / 435 MHz -- a netlist that is NOT the
// RTL that was verified line by line).
//
// So the preset is emitted as a FULL MEMORY IMAGE and applied by the one
